---
const familyRecommendations = [
	{
		text: `Maria helped us through a process with our sensitive preschool child, who reacted strongly to change during a house move and the arrival of a new sibling. Maria was able to describe the challenges we were experiencing from our child’s perspective with great professionalism and a gentleness that radiates love for children and young people. We felt safely guided and encouraged to bring out the best in ourselves and in each other.`,
		author: "Susanne, mother of girls aged 1 and 4.",
	},
	{
		text: `Maria is without a doubt one of the most welcoming and competent people we have ever met. She was crucial in helping us understand the reasons behind our daughter’s intense outbursts and ongoing emotional overload. Where countless educators in her daycare had been unable to find a solution, Maria had the answer. Through simple but effective tools for understanding our daughter’s needs and feelings, Maria helped us turn her state of overwhelm into balance, so that she is thriving today. It is difficult to describe what a positive change this has created for our daughter. We can only offer Maria our warmest recommendation.`,
		author: "Sebastian, father of girls aged 2 and 5.",
	},
	{
		text: `Without you, Maria, I honestly do not know where my family would be today. As I always say when I talk about you and the enormous help you have been to me: everyone should have a Maria like mine. You helped me find my way back to a good relationship with my daughter. You helped me reduce the constant frustration I carried and made me see my daughter and her real needs and feelings. You have shown me how to handle my daughter’s angry outbursts and how to help her feel safe, also in being exactly who she is. I am still amazed at how quickly my daughter has responded to the things I do differently now. After you joined my daughter’s wellbeing meeting, we really got the collaboration with teachers and educators moving using the principles we had worked on together. Now both drop-off and learning are functioning. They have gained a new understanding of how children can be met, and this is now being used across the whole class. It is wonderful for me to watch my child grow and thrive.`,
		author: "Louise, mother of girls aged 7 and 12.",
	},
	{
		text: `We are deeply grateful to Maria for her invaluable guidance, which has been provided in English in both online and offline sessions. Her practical tips and compassionate advice have helped us become more caring and effective parents while fostering a nurturing environment for our children. We highly recommend her support to parents seeking to strengthen their parenting skills and family bonds.`,
		author: "Jonas, father of boys aged 3 and 4.",
	},
	{
		text: `Family guidance with Maria has given me a new perspective on how I can meet and make room for my son. It has given me concrete tools to move forward in difficult situations. I am a single mother, so at times I really need someone to reflect with about how I can best meet my son. Maria is deeply understanding, and I always feel met in the challenges I bring. Maria has also joined me in school meetings. There she is an extra set of ears and asks questions that I might not have thought to ask myself.`,
		author: "Gitte, mother of a 12-year-old boy.",
	},
];

const institutionRecommendations = [
	{
		text: `When I find myself in a situation where I want to do my very best and give a child the best possible conditions for thriving, I ask myself: What would Maria have done? In our preschool, Maria has helped both educators and parents gain a better understanding of children’s expressions. She has helped the entire staff group look behind a child’s behaviour and focus on the messages that really matter. In difficult situations, she opens up new ways of acting, and that strengthens the relationship. You become wiser about your own patterns of response and begin to see the child’s positive intention behind behaviour that may otherwise seem difficult. We have also had Maria join us for a parents’ evening, where she inspired and supported parents in ordinary everyday situations such as sibling conflict, demands, and emotional responses. Maria communicates with warmth, spaciousness, and recognition, and she creates both safety and enormous respect for her knowledge and her ability to turn tangled relationships into resource-oriented developmental environments. We are nowhere near finished becoming better with Maria. We want more.`,
		author: "Maj-Britt, head of institution.",
	},
	{
		text: `We had the pleasure of inviting Maria to our preschool for a parents’ evening under the heading See Behind Your Child’s Behaviour and Understand Their Needs. It was a truly valuable investment that we warmly recommend. Maria has a rare ability to communicate a complex subject with a combination of professional depth, presence, and humour. She creates a space where parents feel seen, met, and inspired, and where there is room for laughter along the way, even when the topics are close to the heart. It was clear that the parents left with concrete tools, new perspectives, and a greater understanding of their children’s emotional needs. Many expressed that they could recognise themselves in her examples and felt relieved that it was not just them experiencing challenges in family life. As both a leader and participant, I can only say that it was an important and powerful talk, and I give Maria my warmest recommendation. She leaves both heart and mind in motion, and we look forward to inviting her again.`,
		author: "Tine, head of institution.",
	},
	{
		text: `Following a programme with Maria has been a great gift for me, both as an educator and as a leader. The tools have remained right at the top of my drawer ever since. Maria has a way of making what feels difficult and unsolvable become meaningful, simple, understandable, and, above all, manageable and useful. After experiencing one of her parent talks, I would say that Maria truly hits the mark and has a remarkable ability to bring everyone along through grounded examples and her warm, spacious presence.`,
		author: "Henriette, head of institution.",
	},
];
---

